      "content": "i mean, i get that wiring can be bad, but the timing is just too perfect. it's not just a random flicker, it's like it's synced up with my heartbeat when i'm angry. it's starting to feel less like an accident and more like my body is just... releasing something. i've been feeling this weird pressure in my chest right before it happens. do u think there's any way to control it? like, maybe i can learn to stabilize my energy so i don't keep causing problems at the office?",
